  <section id="trips" class="shortlist">
    <div class="sl-head">
      <p class="sl-eyebrow">Trip Shortlist</p>
      <h2>Thirteen ranked ways to spend the same two weeks</h2>
      <p>Ranked by the scoreboard — pure data, no preference thumb on the scale; the top score is outlined in red. Tap any card for the full day-by-day itinerary. Nights pill = hotel (bed) nights; the <b>+1</b> chip is the red-eye/travel night away.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "hub/cards.njk" %}
    {% if false %}
    <div class="sl-grid">
      <a class="sl-card top" href="locations/portugal/index.html">
        <div class="sl-photo"><img src="assets/img/portugal/google_cascais_boca_01.jpg" alt="Boca do Inferno sea arch and Cascais cliffs in bright Atlantic light." loading="lazy"><div class="sl-rank">#1</div></div>
        <div class="sl-body">
          <div class="sl-meta"><span class="sl-dates">Jun 10–23</span><span class="sl-score" aria-label="Rated 41 out of 50"><b>41</b><span>/50<small>rating</small></span></span><span class="sl-pto">8 PTO</span></div>
          <div class="sl-titlerow"><h3>Portugal Algarve &amp; Madeira</h3><span class="sl-nights"><b>12</b><i>nights</i><span class="sl-away" title="+1 night in transit (red-eye/travel)">+1</span></span></div>
          <p class="sl-desc">The new #1 at 41/50: the only plan whose reconciled family range stays entirely under the $12k target, with 12 nights and simple three-base geography. The tradeoffs are cool 63–70°F Atlantic water and an exact-date Faro–Funchal flight that must be proven before booking.</p>
          <div class="sl-div"></div>
          <div class="sl-logi"><div><span class="lbl">Route</span><br>Cascais → Carvoeiro → Ponta do Sol</div><div><span class="lbl">Budget</span><br>$7.5k–11.7k</div><div><span class="lbl">Swim</span><br>Atlantic 63–70°F</div><div><span class="lbl">Bases</span><br>3 bases</div></div>
          <div class="sl-tags"><span>#1 overall, 41/50</span><span>Best value</span><span>Simplest air</span><span class="warn">Coldest water</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="sl-card" href="locations/madeira-mallorca/index.html">
        <div class="sl-photo"><img src="assets/img/madeira-mallorca/google_funchal_cable_car_01.jpg" alt="Funchal cable car rising over the city and bay." loading="lazy"><div class="sl-rank">#2</div></div>
        <div class="sl-body">
          <div class="sl-meta"><span class="sl-dates">Jun 8–21</span><span class="sl-score" aria-label="Rated 39 out of 50"><b>39</b><span>/50<small>rating</small></span></span><span class="sl-pto">8 PTO</span></div>
          <div class="sl-titlerow"><h3>Madeira + Mallorca</h3><span class="sl-nights"><b>12</b><i>nights</i><span class="sl-away" title="+1 night in transit (red-eye/travel)">+1</span></span></div>
          <p class="sl-desc">#2 at 39/50: Madeira supplies the ridge and levada scenery; Mallorca supplies shallow sandy Mediterranean swimming. The score now treats Mallorca swim as 4/5 and Madeira weather as 4/5. Exact 2027 EWR–FNC dates and through-ticket protection remain quote gates.</p>
          <div class="sl-div"></div>
