          <div class="sl-tags"><span>Top hybrid score, 39/50</span><span>Within-preference</span><span>Hiking + Med swim</span><span class="warn">FNC wind risk</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="sl-card" href="locations/portugal-sicily/index.html">
