        <div class="sl-body">
          <div class="sl-meta"><span class="sl-dates">Jun 8–21</span><span class="sl-score" aria-label="Rated 37 out of 50"><b>37</b><span>/50<small>rating</small></span></span><span class="sl-pto">8 PTO</span></div>
          <div class="sl-titlerow"><h3>Portugal + Sicily</h3><span class="sl-nights"><b>12</b><i>nights</i><span class="sl-away" title="+1 night in transit (red-eye/travel)">+1</span></span></div>
          <p class="sl-desc">#3 at 37/50: a within-preference Portugal and Sicily combination with excellent food, variety, and novelty. The current plan cannot assume a Lisbon–Palermo nonstop on its chosen weekday; exact 2027 service or a protected one-stop is required.</p>
