          <div class="sl-tags"><span>Portugal + Italy</span><span>#3 overall, 37/50</span><span class="warn">Near preferred maximum</span><span class="warn">LIS-Palermo monopoly</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="sl-card" href="locations/iceland/index.html">
