        <div class="sl-body">
          <div class="sl-meta"><span class="sl-dates">Jun 8–21</span><span class="sl-score" aria-label="Rated 36 out of 50"><b>36</b><span>/50<small>rating</small></span></span><span class="sl-pto">8 PTO</span></div>
          <div class="sl-titlerow"><h3>Iceland: South Coast &amp; Glacier Lagoons</h3><span class="sl-nights"><b>12</b><i>nights</i><span class="sl-away" title="+1 night in transit (red-eye/travel)">+1</span></span></div>
          <p class="sl-desc">#4 at 36/50: the strongest visual contrast on the board, with geothermal bathing rather than sea swimming. Four bases, the long east-to-west return drive, volcanic/weather disruption, and unconfirmed exact 2027 nonstop days keep Ease and Risk below their previous optimistic scores.</p>
