          <div class="sl-tags"><span>Now #4, 36/50</span><span>Novel geothermal swim</span><span>Novelty 5/5</span><span class="warn">Cool, wet weather</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="sl-card" href="locations/portugal-crete/index.html">
