          <div class="sl-meta"><span class="sl-dates">Jun 8–21</span><span class="sl-score" aria-label="Rated 35 out of 50"><b>35</b><span>/50<small>rating</small></span></span><span class="sl-pto">8 PTO</span></div>
          <div class="sl-titlerow"><h3>Portugal + Crete</h3><span class="sl-nights"><b>12</b><i>nights</i><span class="sl-away" title="+1 night in transit (red-eye/travel)">+1</span></span></div>
          <p class="sl-desc">#5 at 35/50: five Portugal nights now make Lisbon and the Sintra coast a real half of the trip, while seven Crete nights still deliver warmer water and one family-sized gorge. The $11.2k–15.4k range remains quote-gated, and the Jun 14 connection must book as one protected itinerary.</p>
