          <div class="sl-tags"><span>Best warm-water fix</span><span>Fixes cold water</span><span>Lowest hybrid cost</span><span class="warn">Crosses $15k preference at high end</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="sl-card" href="locations/sicily-malta/index.html">
        <div class="sl-photo"><img src="assets/img/sicily-malta/google_cefalu_larocca_beach_01.jpg" alt="Cefalu old town and beach at the foot of La Rocca." loading="lazy"><div class="sl-rank">#6</div></div>
        <div class="sl-body">
          <div class="sl-meta"><span class="sl-dates">Jun 10–23</span><span class="sl-score" aria-label="Rated 35 out of 50"><b>35</b><span>/50<small>rating</small></span></span><span class="sl-pto">8 PTO</span></div>
          <div class="sl-titlerow"><h3>Sicily &amp; Malta</h3><span class="sl-nights"><b>12</b><i>nights</i><span class="sl-away" title="+1 night in transit (red-eye/travel)">+1</span></span></div>
