    <h2>Choose the priority</h2>
    <p>The default ranking uses Budget at double weight plus Weather, Swim, Variety, Ease, Food, Risk, Nights, and Novelty; PTO is displayed and available for custom weighting. <b>Portugal</b> leads at 41/50 because its reconciled range stays below the $12k target. <b>Madeira + Mallorca</b> is the top hybrid at 39, followed by <b>Portugal + Sicily</b> at 37 and <b>Iceland</b> at 36. Scores remain provisional where exact 2027 schedules or preference-fit quotes are still unverified. <b>Albania</b>, <b>Balkans</b>, <b>California</b>, <b>Canary Islands</b>, <b>Croatia</b>, <b>Southern France</b>, and <b>Turkish Riviera</b> are excluded by family decision. Click a row to highlight that trip in the scoreboard.</p>
