      <article class="winner-card"><h3>Most adventurous</h3><p><b>Balkans</b> has the biggest adventure arc but is excluded by family decision (kept for reference); <b>Turkish Riviera</b> is the cleanest ranked adventure-lite alternative.</p></article>
