    <p class="source-note">Comparison basis: 22 plans (13 ranked, 9 excluded by family decision) across an early-June-to-August planning range. Jun 6 is the nominal start, with Spain (Jun 3) and Hawaii (Jun 5) retained as explicit early-departure options. A Jun 23 return to Pittsburgh is acceptable and preferred, including an evening arrival; the only hard calendar rule is that the family must be in Pittsburgh all day Jun 24-26. Budgets are planning bands, not booking quotes, and several high cases exceed the $15k preferred maximum. Exact 2027 seasonal schedules remain verification gates, especially Greece's return, the Lisbon-Palermo handoffs, and Madeira nonstop patterns. Portugal + Algarve + Sicily is the scenery-first, higher-mobility alternative to Portugal + Sicily: it preserves Sicily’s payoff but adds an Algarve rental/backtrack and a critical schedule gate.</p>
